  "description": "An offer to give 100 million won for bringing a ballpoint pen.  \nFor his family in need, Han Seojin pretends to be a partner for the night.  \nHe is heading to the house of Choi Moohyun, executive director of Daeil Air.  \nBut with a cynical smile and cold eyes, Muhyun, who looks clean and perfect without any flaws, pushed Seojin away.  \nSeojin gives up his last pride and begs him…\n\n[Original Novel](https://ridibooks.com/books/3074000270)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/3846000142), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/trigger), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/trigger_), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000063192)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[French](https://www.lezhinfr.com/detail/bt_1110216), [Japanese](https://www.cmoa.jp/title/293891/), [German](https://www.lezhinde.com/detail/dbd_00058), [Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/thwt_3747)",
